\par
sensitive to the baseline efficacy of conventional therapy during
\par
the maintenance phase and the relative efficacy of tofacitinib
\par
and vedolizumab. As these efficacy data improved, the patients
\par
assigned to the vedolizumab and tofacitinib treatment experi-
\par
enced greater economic outcomes. The GEMINI trial found
