\par
meta-analysis investigating different published trials to project
\par
the economic outcomes of 14 treatment sequences due to the
\par
absence of direct comparison trials between tofacitinib, adal-
\par
imumab, vedolizumab, golimumab,infliximab, and placebo.
\par
Furthermore, we only used a fixed-effects model due to the
\par
small size of the network. This approach assumes that a true
\par
treatment effect is common in all trials and the patient char-
\par
acteristics are similar. Thus, credible intervals may be under-
\par
estimated, which could generate uncertainty regarding the
\par
findings. The evaluations should be updated when real-world
\par
data directly comparing these strategies become available.
