\par
greatest monitoring response, instead of simply the nearest monitor,
\par
since the simulation incorporates spatial variability that yields irre-
\par
gular, anisotropic concentration elds and monitoring signals. More-
\par
over, the methodology is expanded to use the summarized monitoring
\par
response scenarios from the stochastic simulations given more
