\par
Bayesian decision models are becoming increasingly pop-
\par
ular in the health economics domain. Many EVPPI tech-
\par
niques [2]--[7] have been specifically developed for Bayesian
\par
models computed by Monte Carlo (MC) or Markov Chain
\par
Monte Carlo (MCMC) sampling approaches. These models
\par
are often represented by a set of mathematical equations that
\par
show the CPDs and the functions of each parameter.
