\par
can be found in Section 2.3). This measure consists of 6 primary indicators (AS1--AS6) and 24 secondary
\par
indicators (C1--C24). We adopt the hybrid raw data (precise value, interval numbers, and fuzzy
\par
numbers) to obtain information aggregation to represent the actual performance of each indicator.
\par
